          "path": "_m/s/x/k/9/zeyrek-wp/home-sweat-home-01348.jpg",
          "filename": "Home Sweat Home 01348.jpg",
          "caption": "Self-made unstable architecture in a city that earthquakes are expected soon or later. Makers and patchers of buildings of this kind ignore all accumulated knowledge in architecture, risking their own lives. Poverty might be one of the reasons for structures like this. Lack of access to knowledge, access to people with knowledge, materials and resources needed to make a healthy building could all be traced back to poverty. Istanbul, Turkey",
